    "text": "Valley County, Idaho\nPolice: McCall man dies in hospital following Highway 55 crash\n3 hours ago\nBOISE, Idaho — A man who was involved in a crash involving three pickup trucks Monday died from injuries sustained in the crash, Idaho State Police reported Wednesday. Police said the crash happened on State Highway 55 in Valley County when a 30-year-old man from McCall, driving a red Ram 1500 southbound, crossed into oncoming traffic and collided with two trucks.",
